# VideoBrief — AI pipeline

## Abstraction

```text
AIProvider
  analyzeVideo / determineContextQuestions / generatePersonalizedSummary
```

Implement with Vercel AI SDK. Default model: **Claude Haiku**. Do not hard-code Claude SDK calls outside the provider.

## Pipeline stages (domain)

1. Metadata + English transcript
2. Video understanding → structured (type, topics, chapters, candidate questions)
3. Filter questions against existing user context
4. Optional user answers → persist by scope
5. Personalized summary → structured → persist

## Validation (required)

```text
LLM → structured output → Zod.parse → app types → DB
```

Never persist raw/unvalidated model JSON. Schemas must cover timestamps, titles, summaries, topics, questions, takeaways.

## Personalization

Change emphasis, depth, and framing — not invent unrelated content. Skip questions already answered in stored context.

## Cost

Reuse intermediate analysis; avoid duplicate full-transcript calls; Haiku for all MVP stages.
